{"time": 1760266247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "442658669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056525690", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（厉害）"}
{"time": 1760266250, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1737218524", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056525690", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "旁白：”宇宙并不该被观察。观察创造思想，思想塑形现实。“"}
{"time": 1760266257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1645773510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056525690", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "镜头从太空升起，无数繁星在屏幕里闪烁。"}
{"time": 1760266268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1264172114", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056525690", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "”一群同类思想的超大量聚集，或是一个极为强烈的单体思想，就有可能使正确且真实的事物产生不自然的扭曲。我们称这些扭曲为异常体。”"}
{"time": 1760266280, "type": "recv", "message_id": "419155591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056525690", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#画面产生些许扭曲，映出不可名状之物"}
{"time": 1760266296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "640089785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056525690", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“异常体是极度危险的。它们必须被捕捉并控制，以免它们在现实中撕开空洞，让我们经受比任何世俗头脑所能想象得都更加强大的力量所带来的伤害。三角机构是一家代表了公共利益的私营公司，它迎接了这一挑战。”"}
{"time": 1760266302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1344632449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056525690", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#红色的三角logo占领屏幕的c位"}
{"time": 1760266309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "661083623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056525690", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“没有机构，就会有混乱——而哪里有混乱，哪里就有破坏、痛苦和心碎。”"}
{"time": 1760266316, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1778346151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056525690", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "#一个人从屏幕外走出来"}
{"time": 1760266323, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2120854263", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056525690", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“作为一名外勤特工，您将加入这支历史悠久、横贯时空的员工队伍，肩负起我们宇宙的持续存在。幸而，在混乱的世界里维持秩序是一项受感激的工作。”"}
{"time": 1760266330, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1612522743", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1056525690", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“这是您收到的第一次：谢谢您！”"}
